Draft date: 2026-09-28
Status: Individual scene draft; whole-film pass provisionally accepted, individual author review pending

EXT./INT. LOCK-UP AREA/MAC'S OFFICE/FARMHOUSE - DAY

Voss and Vale withdraw from the police response to Reyes's death. Mac demands an update; they demand to know why he hid Elias's risk and what his authority over Zoe actually rests on. The contract supplies words, not an independent answer.

At the farmhouse Elias considers Reyes's phone. Voss and Vale keep a clean handset apart from their old channel. Zoe insists on attending any meeting.

ZOE
If I'm the reason you're meeting, I am in the room.

Elias initiates one bounded contact. Voss receives it. Each side assumes the other may be monitored.
